<title>INDIA: India's RBI rejects all bids at repo auction.</title>
<headline>India's RBI rejects all bids at repo auction.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it rejected all bids at a repo auction of government securities on Friday.  </p>
<p>The RBI said it received six bids for 46.50 billion rupees and rejected all. It did not give details.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
